                                "sense_id": "495f1621-3b10-3572-a793-b96fa508dad7",
                                "text": "Smith provided the winner of twenty-one Mares Produce Stakes and quinellaed the event nine times."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "66b58f18-946e-4d34-aa66-7b800629fb85",
                                "sense_id": "495f1621-3b10-3572-a793-b96fa508dad7",
                                "text": "Gai quinellaed the Doncaster in 1997 with Secret Savings and All Our Mob."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "388d858a-1e05-4f99-b42c-704ccf2a6812",
                                "sense_id": "495f1621-3b10-3572-a793-b96fa508dad7",
                                "text": "Not only did he win his first Cup with the 30/1 chance Tawriffic, but in the finest Cummings′ tradition he quinellaed the race with Super Impose."
